sub1:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals-overall> .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Cartwright & Checa (2007), Cartwright et al. (2009) & BCF (1951) nacre screw-dislocation spirals, Frank-Read target loops, and chitin pore mineral-bridge columnar vs sheet transition — MorphoEval overall 48.9/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "Pass 1 (v1) baseline evaluation of `2019-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals.py` (consensus score 52.8/100). The v1 script evaluates an analytical Cabrera-Levine phase field for a single isolated screw dislocation (r_c=0.42 um, lambda_0=7.97 um), but omits opposite-charge (+1, -1) Frank-Read target-ring generation for d > 2*r_c, subcritical dipole annihilation for d <= 2*r_c, sub-saturated (Delta_mu <= 0) zero-growth negative control, Voronoi polygonal tablet tessellation upon terrace coalescence, chitin mineral-bridge gastropod (*Haliotis*) columnar vs bivalve (*Pteria*) sheet nacre transition, supersaturation and 12-species cross-taxa scaling, and computer-vision segmentation of the vendored SEM nacre specimen. Overall 48.9/100 (faithfulness 41.6, reproducibility 65.9); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit HEAD; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 56, Morphological realism / specimen match 24, Parameter expressivity 44, Morphometric validation 50, Source and data traceability 64, Code-to-model traceability 62, Reproducibility package 70. Output judged: docs/media/nacre_screw_dislocation_spirals_comparison.png: rendered output of 2019-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals.py at HEAD, image/png, 126657 B, 1149×569 px, artifact_sha256 096391d8be69d37506de9889872060a5d580ea74f090a0c8d1aa96992d815881 (sha256 096391d8be69d37506de9889872060a5d580ea74f090a0c8d1aa96992d815881), spec_fingerprint d2c5586744b4a1dd453b702e1ae3b35d30b5d54166476472d0304e0d22c70b82. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: d2c5586744b4a1dd453b702e1ae3b35d30b5d54166476472d0304e0d22c70b82; artifact_sha256: 096391d8be69d37506de9889872060a5d580ea74f090a0c8d1aa96992d815881; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/nacre_screw_dislocation_spirals/haliotis_nacre_spirals_specimen.jpg=e4c6590464523f21..., datasets/nacre_screw_dislocation_spirals/nacre_screw_dislocation_spirals_reference.json=9de7ae07e42d2993..., datasets/nacre_screw_dislocation_spirals/paper_citations.bib=3df311760cfbb299..., datasets/nacre_screw_dislocation_spirals/scout_manifest.json=22cd8415a0587395...}." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Expose full CLI parameter overrides (`--v-inf`, `--r-c`, `--delta-mu`, `--h-0`, `--dipole-d`, `--seed`, `--skip-gif`, `--verify-only`), upgrade `self_test()` to an 8-point verification suite with bitwise two-run determinism, and render a 6-panel publication-grade synthesis figure and co-evolving 2-panel growth GIF.",
            "remediation needed: Implement a 2D Phase-Field / Excitable BCF Spiral Wave + Chitin-Membrane Mineral Bridge solver reproducing all 5 Cartwright-Checa morphospace regimes: (1) sub-saturated zero-growth negative control (Delta_mu = -0.20 k_B T <= 0 -> 0 terraces), (2) subcritical Frank-Read dipole (d = 0.60 um < 2*r_c = 0.84 um -> pinch-off failure, 0 terraces), (3) single screw dislocation (+b = +1 -> Archimedean spiral in bivalve sheet nacre *Pteria*), (4) supercritical opposite-charge Frank-Read pair (+1, -1, d = 2.40 um > 2*r_c, B_tot = 0 -> closed concentric target terraces), and (5) gastropod (*Haliotis rufescens*) chitin mineral-bridge columnar nacre stacks & Voronoi polygonal tablet coalescence.",
            "remediation needed: Load and SHA-256-verify `datasets/nacre_screw_dislocation_spirals/` at runtime, validate terrace wavelength lambda_0 ≈ 18.9848*r_c ≈ 19*r_c across chemical supersaturation Delta_mu (r > 0.999) and across 12 empirical bivalve sheet-nacre and gastropod/cephalopod tower-nacre species, and verify Voronoi polygonal tablet tessellation (mean hexagonal coordination Z ≈ 6.0).",
            "remediation needed: Perform computer-vision lamellar seam and Voronoi tablet segmentation (`segment_nacre_sem_specimen`) on the vendored SEM mother-of-pearl specimen (`haliotis_nacre_spirals_specimen.jpg`), measuring aragonite inter-lamellar terrace spacing h_0 (0.5000 um, CV = 0.2933), hexagonal coordination number Z (5.96), and tablet aspect ratio (3.2436)." ;
        pk:hasScore "0.489"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Gemini 4 Argon (Pass 1 baseline assessor)" ;
        dcterms:identifier "gemini-4-argon" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf orcid:0009-0007-4948-9192 ;
        foaf:homepage <https://deepmind.google> .
}

